{
  "storyboard": {
    "action": "The cat noses a wedge of cheese to the base of an upright box, then shoves its muzzle under the box's edge and heaves the box up until its raised corner rests on the cheese. The cat pads left, leaps onto a low stump and crouches there, watching. A mouse pops out of its hole, sniffs the cheese, and drags it away; robbed of its prop the box starts to topple, and the cat springs off the stump. The box slams down over the cat, leaving only its hindquarters and tail sticking out, while the mouse scurries back into its hole with the cheese.",
    "notes": [
      "Both animals stay strictly quadrupedal: they push, nose, drag and pounce with head, mouth, paws and body weight only.",
      "Fixed side view on a single ground line: box trap centre-right, stump and mouse hole lower left, open ground between them.",
      "Cat: outline quadruped with pointed ears, whiskers and a long curling tail; Mouse: small compact quadruped with large round ears, pointed nose and a long thin tail.",
      "The box is propped only by the cheese wedge, so pulling the cheese must visibly precede the box toppling."
    ],
    "beats": [
      {
        "start": 1,
        "end": 8,
        "event": "The cat lowers its head and noses the cheese wedge forward until it sits against the base of the box's left edge.",
        "exit": "The cheese is tucked at the box's left edge with the cat's muzzle on it; the box is still flat on the ground and the cat's weight is on its front paws."
      },
      {
        "start": 9,
        "end": 18,
        "event": "The cat shoves its muzzle under the box's left edge and heaves; the box tilts up on its right edge and settles with its raised corner resting on the cheese wedge.",
        "exit": "The box stands propped at an angle on the cheese and the cat has pulled its head clear and stepped back, looking at the set trap."
      },
      {
        "start": 19,
        "end": 28,
        "event": "The cat pads left, springs onto the stump and flattens itself into a crouch on top, watching the trap.",
        "exit": "The cat is crouched low on the stump at the far left, head forward and eyes on the propped box."
      },
      {
        "start": 29,
        "end": 38,
        "event": "The mouse pops out of its hole, scampers right along the ground and stops with its nose at the cheese, sniffing it.",
        "exit": "The mouse stands at the cheese with its nose against it, tail out behind; the cat stays frozen on the stump."
      },
      {
        "start": 39,
        "end": 46,
        "event": "The mouse grips the cheese in its teeth and drags it left out of the trap; robbed of its prop the box starts to topple, and the cat springs off the stump in a long leap toward the trap.",
        "exit": "The cheese is dragged well clear, the box is tipping over on its right corner, and the cat is airborne mid-leap above the ground."
      },
      {
        "start": 47,
        "end": 54,
        "event": "The cat lands where the trap was and the box slams flat down over it; the mouse keeps running left with the cheese.",
        "exit": "The box lies flat with the cat trapped underneath and only its hind legs and tail sticking out at the left; the mouse is clear to the left with the cheese in its mouth."
      },
      {
        "start": 55,
        "end": 60,
        "event": "The cat struggles under the box while the mouse carries the cheese to its hole and dives in.",
        "exit": "The box stays flat on the cat with its tail thrashing at the left, and the mouse reaches the hole with the cheese."
      }
    ],
